      <p>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR384_0_218_007"/>
        <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR384_0_note_001_218_7" xml:id="start_com_3307"/>In der Leerheit da Sie weg sind<ref xml:id="end_com_3307"/> helf ich mir so gut ich kann. Tracktire 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR384_0_218_008"/>
        <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR384_0_note_002_218_8" xml:id="start_com_3308"/>Misels,<ref xml:id="end_com_3308"/> reite und lauffe herum. Ich<ptr n="1" target="#a001_218.8"/> hoffe Sie bald <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR384_0_note_003_218_8" xml:id="start_com_3309"/>wieder zu sehn<ref xml:id="end_com_3309"/>.    Adieu 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR384_0_218_009"/>liebes <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR384_0_note_004_218_9" xml:id="start_com_3310"/>Gold<ref xml:id="end_com_3310"/>   d<g ref="#typoSuspension"/>. 16. Jul 78</p>
      <closer>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR384_0_218_010"/>
        <signed rend="paraph" rendition="#einrueck17">G.</signed>
      </closer>
